cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, together with the original paper."
title: "Sensitivity Model for Multi-Credit Calibration"
abstract: >-
  Firm-specific loadings on the common compound Poisson jump factor in the
  elastically stopped Lévy multi-credit model of Baker and Capponi. Loadings are
  estimated under the historical measure and held fixed, and the risk-neutral
  parameters are calibrated to CDX index tranches.
